  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.41 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Professional Engineers. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.41, below, shall apply to the profession regulated by the board of professional engineers under RSA 310-A:2-27:\n\nTable 1002.41 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Professional Engineers\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nProfessional engineer license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of active license | 2 years | $165\n\nRenewal or reinstatement after expiration of retired license | 2 years | $82\n\nCertificate of authorization application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of certificate | 2 years | $220\n\nApplication processing and licensing for temporary permit under RSA 310-A:19 | 6 months | $330\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #13821, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 12-14-23, EXPIRED: 6-11-24 (Plc 1002.41 in #13703 effective again pursuant to RSA 541-A:18, V)\n\nNew. #13972, eff 5-22-24; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
